# ホワイトリスト方式: すべて無視し、`!` で許可したものだけを追跡する
*

!/.github/
!/.github/**/
!/.github/CODEOWNERS
!/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yaml
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yaml
!/.github/workflows/ci.yaml
!/.github/workflows/claude.yaml
!/.github/workflows/claude-sweep.yaml

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.editorconfig
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE
!/mise.toml
!/mise.lock
!/fnox.toml
!/.pre-commit-config.yaml
!/commitlint.config.mjs
!/dprint.json
!/renovate.json

!/pyproject.toml
!/uv.lock
!/Dockerfile
!/.dockerignore
!/.env.example
!/src/
!/src/**
!/tests/
!/tests/**
__pycache__/
